The '''Temple of Central Isopter'''<ref name="Star Wars 62">[[Star Wars (2015) 62|''Star Wars'' (2015) 62]]</ref> was a shrine of the [[Central Isopter]] located on [[Jedha]], on the edge of the crater caused by the [[DS-1 Orbital Battle Station|Death Star's]] [[Destruction of Jedha City|destruction]] of [[Jedha City]]. It was visited by [[Luke Skywalker]] and [[Chulco Gi]] during a [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]] [[Battle for Jedha|mission]] to the [[moon]].<ref name="Star Wars 41" />

